          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "যোগব্যায়াম — jogbyāyām — \"yoga (as exercise)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "দাদু রোজ সকালে যোগব্যায়াম করেন। Dādu roj sôkāle jogbyāyām kôren. My grandfather does yoga every morning."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "যোগব্যায়াম (jogbyāyām) joins Sanskrit yoga, \"joining, discipline\", and vyāyāma, \"exertion, struggle\" (Monier-Williams); ব্যায়াম on its own is exercise."
            }
          ]
        },
